 "turns": [
  {
   "index": 0,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "Good evening. Let's start with the hall and the menu. Oren, how are tickets?",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E001"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 1,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "A hundred and twelve sold, at a hundred and twenty-five each.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E002",
    "E003"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 2,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "And the hall holds a hundred and eighty, so there's room.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E004"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 3,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "The menu is forty-eight a head. The caterer needs a final number two weeks out.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E005"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 4,
   "speaker": "Fumiko",
   "text": "Do we order for the tickets sold, or for the hall?",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E006"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 5,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "For the tickets sold, plus ten percent. That's what we did last year.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 6,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "The hall used to be a cannery, you know. My grandfather worked the line there in the fifties.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E007"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 7,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "I didn't know that. How lovely.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 8,
   "speaker": "Fumiko",
   "text": "Is there a vegetarian option this year? Several people asked.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E008"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 9,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "The squash risotto. The caterer says it's popular.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 10,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "Then we'll order on tickets sold plus ten percent, with the risotto as the vegetarian main.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E009"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 11,
   "speaker": "Fumiko",
   "text": "Good.",
   "agenda_item": "venue_menu",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 12,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "The auction. Oren?",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E010"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 13,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "We're at about forty items. Some lovely ones, too.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E011"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 14,
   "speaker": "Fumiko",
   "text": "I have the intake sheet here. It's thirty-one that have actually arrived.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E012"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 15,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "Thirty-one in hand, and about nine more promised. Fair point.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E013"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 16,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "What's the best item so far?",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E014"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 17,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "The guided canoe trip on the reserve. And the hand-made quilt from the Hendersons.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 18,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "Should we put the quilt in a live auction instead of the silent one?",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E015",
    "E016"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 19,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "It might do better live. One live item is a nice moment in the evening.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 20,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "Who'd run the live part? We don't have an auctioneer.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E017"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 21,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "I could do it. I've done it at the school before.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E018"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 22,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "That would be perfect.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 23,
   "speaker": "Fumiko",
   "text": "It might help if someone chased the nine promised items this week.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E019"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 24,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "I'll call the nine donors on Monday and confirm drop-off dates.",
   "agenda_item": "auction",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E020"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 25,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "Sponsors. Desmond?",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E021"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 26,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "Five sponsors, fourteen thousand five hundred in total.",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E022",
    "E023"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 27,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "The goal for the evening is sixty thousand.",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E024"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 28,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "Last year we raised fifty-eight thousand, so sixty is within reach.",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E025",
    "E026"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 29,
   "speaker": "Fumiko",
   "text": "My neighbor just put solar panels on her whole roof. She says her bill is nearly zero.",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E027"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 30,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "My brother-in-law is thinking about it. The installers are booked for months.",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 31,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "Could we ask the solar company to sponsor? It fits what we do.",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E028"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 32,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "That's a good thought. Let's think about it for next year, since the program is printed already.",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E029"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 33,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "Has anyone heard back from the bank about renewing their sponsorship?",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E030"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 34,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "The brewery wants to donate the beer instead of cash. Is that okay?",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E031"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 35,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "That's fine. In-kind counts, I just record it differently.",
   "agenda_item": "sponsors",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E032"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 36,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "Volunteers. Fumiko?",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E033"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 37,
   "speaker": "Fumiko",
   "text": "We need twenty and we have thirteen.",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E034",
    "E035"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 38,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "Seven short. Where are the gaps?",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E036"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 39,
   "speaker": "Fumiko",
   "text": "Setup in the afternoon, and cleanup at the end. Nobody wants cleanup.",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 40,
   "speaker": "Desmond",
   "text": "I'll do cleanup. I'm always last to leave anyway.",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E037"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 41,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "Could we ask the high school's environmental club? They need service hours.",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E038"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 42,
   "speaker": "Fumiko",
   "text": "That's a good idea. I'll email their teacher tomorrow.",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E039"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 43,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "Then Desmond has cleanup, and we ask the club to cover setup.",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E040"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 44,
   "speaker": "Oren",
   "text": "And the date's still October fourth for everyone, right? A sponsor asked me.",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E041",
    "E042"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  },
  {
   "index": 45,
   "speaker": "Beatrice",
   "text": "October fourth. Nothing's changed. Thank you, everyone. A lovely meeting.",
   "agenda_item": "volunteers",
   "direction": null,
   "event_ids": [
    "E043"
   ],
   "interrupted": false
  }
 ],
